The idea of having Stormbringer actually bring a storm is inconsistent with
the Elric books by Michael Moorcock.  In the books, Elric is overcome with
madness when using the sword, which did suck the life out of its victims.
He would attack anything around him, including the ones he loved.

Perhaps a character wielding Stormbringer could lose control and attack every-
thing around him (including his pets, shopkeepers, priests/priestesses) while
under the influence of the sword's madness.  This would make using Stormbringer
a little riskier.

P.S., what is the origination of Mjollnir?  Does it have possibilities like
Stormbringer?
